{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Z8jHOSzIKR1794537965.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《美食新聞報道》首站帶領觀眾探訪極具水準的韓式料理店，品嚐多款地道又充滿創意的韓國美食！</p><p><strong>高質韓式料理：爆膏生醃瀨尿蝦與暖胃牛大腸鍋</strong></p><p>喜歡韓國菜的食客，不能錯過這間提供多款創意與地道兼備美食的韓式料理店。當中最令人驚艷的招牌菜，必定是「自家製醬油生醃瀨尿蝦」。店家嚴選本地新鮮大隻的斑馬瀨尿蝦，以特製醬油慢泡入味。瀨尿蝦的肉質極為鮮甜，鮮橙色的蝦膏帶來甘甜軟滑的口感，醬油香氣非但沒有蓋過海鮮原味，反而將鮮味完美昇華。</p><p>內臟愛好者則必試「韓式牛大腸鍋 (Kopchang Jongol)」。湯底選用韓國直送的多款牛部位熬煮，包括小腸、毛肚、大腸及稀有的「牛沙瓜」，再加入店家自製的辣椒醬。清甜的牛骨湯伴隨大腸爆漿的油脂香氣與微辣滋味，不但惹味，更極具解酒與暖胃的效果。</p><p><strong>餐廳資料</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Mr. Korean BBQ</strong></p></li><li><p>地址：銅鑼灣駱克道491-499號京都廣場5樓</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"5505e7d5-c3d9-4d51-a859-1d1526160f66.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20262Hb1JiBaMf1794537964.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8e7330cf-1a82-4546-9481-1e2e899c8ce0.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20267cn4tMR3o81794537964.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"c21957d6-1aff-42d7-96d1-1d59efd5b02f.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026MApo0NA9GE1794537963.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>正宗西班牙美饌：香脆生烤乳豬與足料紅蝦海鮮飯</strong></p><p>另一間推介餐廳則洋溢著歐洲酒莊與鄉村風情，由西班牙大廚親自主理，融合多個地區特色，呈獻正宗西班牙佳餚。打頭陣的招牌菜「生烤乳豬」皮薄極脆，切開時更會發出清脆聲響，肉質軟嫩多汁；墊底的薯仔吸滿了肉香與香草牛油的精華，呈現外焦內軟的絕佳口感。</p><p>「西班牙紅蝦海鮮飯」則選用來自西班牙的優質米及新鮮海鮮，配上秘製番茄汁與濃郁的蝦頭膏烹調。每粒米飯都顆顆分明，徹底吸收了鮮甜的海鮮精華，底部的鍋巴更是焦香酥脆。</p><p>此外，不能錯過令人回味無窮的街頭小食「馬德里傳統夾肉包」。大廚將牛肉以慢火熬煮一整晚至極度軟嫩，再配搭焦糖化洋蔥與珍貴的花膠，一同夾入特製麵包之中，帶來層次豐富的奢華享受。</p><p><strong>餐廳資料</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Rustico</strong></p></li><li><p>地址：荔枝角長義街9號D2 Place ONE地下G01號舖</p></li></ul><p><p><img alt=\"87a86729-c9c6-4fc3-aae0-7ad959295da6.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026sELD91yVCo1794537966.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"b03ffe88-b63b-4117-9df9-cc7cafb154fe.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20268AR1NNEBQS1794537966.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8491b795-bf14-4ff4-aa32-88ca001910fc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026BuI4vmrkAR1794537966.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2a2a2070-5b7a-422f-9922-7cf1ae143fe3.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026lsgx4u3ZL61794537965.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"119c360a-0cdc-4e2e-b485-edcd6be44f9b.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20261n2SeG3XXk1794537965.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.538835+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":733,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T22:17:36.316775+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:33.197444+00:00","content_hash":"1011861dd09aa867d913bfbb9573e0f77649354f7f214e24b95725e9fbc00fef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}